   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ARM lantm&#xe4;teri III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r tredje fasen i ett lantm&#xe4;teriprojekt i Armenien. M&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att f&#xe5; fram ett fungerande fastighetsregister. Projektet kommer att p&#xe5;g&#xe5; under 2006-2009. Tyngdpunkten ligger p&#xe5; utbildning i GIS och i geodetik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the third phase in a land management project in Armenia. The overall objective is to contribute to the establishment of a well functioning real property system. Most of the activities concentrate on training of trainers in GIS and geodesy. The project will be carried out 2006-2009.</narrative>
  </description>
